---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About" description="Learn about Democracy Direct and our mission.">
  <main class="container mx-auto px-4 py-8 flex-1">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-8">About Democracy Direct</h1>

    <section class="prose prose-lg max-w-3xl">
      <h2>Our Mission</h2>
      <p>Make civic engagement effortless, private, and accessible to everyone.</p>

      <h2>The Problem</h2>
      <p>
        Contacting elected representatives is unnecessarily difficult. Finding who represents you
        requires navigating multiple government websites. Representatives don't publish email
        addresses. Most people don't know how to write an effective letter. Existing tools require
        accounts and track usage.
      </p>

      <h2 id="privacy">Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        We believe civic participation should not require surveillance. We don't store your email
        address—when you log in, we hash it using SHA-256 and store only the hash. We don't log your
        ZIP code lookups. We never see your letters.
      </p>

      <h2 id="data-sources">Data Sources</h2>
      <p>All representative data comes from public sources:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <a
            href="https://github.com/unitedstates/congress-legislators"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
          >
            unitedstates/congress-legislators
          </a> - Legislator information
        </li>
        <li>Census Bureau - ZIP-to-district mapping</li>
        <li>Congress.gov - Voting records (coming soon)</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Have questions or feedback? Open an issue on our
        <a
          href="https://github.com/anomalousventures/democracy-direct"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
        >
          GitHub repository
        </a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="border-t border-border py-8">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-4">
        <p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm">
          © {new Date().getFullYear()} Democracy Direct
        </p>
        <nav class="flex gap-6">
          <a href="/" class="text-sm text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground transition-colors">
            Home
          </a>
          <a
            href="/privacy"
            class="text-sm text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground transition-colors"
          >
            Privacy
          </a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>
</Layout>
